// BP - Role Editor Blacklist (record name still says "Whitelist" so sites update in place)
//
// The role editor (Roles on User, Roles on Role Profile) hides the roles in BP_HIDDEN_ROLES and shows
// every other role (Bry, 2026-10-19: blacklist instead of whitelist, so a new role appears without
// editing this script). Disabled roles never appear (core get_all_roles filters disabled = 0), so an
// unused standard role is hidden by disabling the Role, not by listing it here.
// Every listed role is hidden AND disabled, for everyone including System Manager:
//   - hidden: the checkbox is not shown;
//   - disabled: "Select All" / "Unselect All" skip it (multicheck.select_all ignores disabled
//     checkboxes), so whoever holds it keeps it and whoever doesn't, doesn't get it from this form.
// To give one of them, remove it from the list, give it, then put it back (or assign it through a
// Role Profile).
// Cosmetic only: the Hicom Server Scripts on User still decide what may be saved.

const BP_HIDDEN_ROLES = [
	"Customer",
	"Employee",
	"Script Manager",
	"Supplier",
	"System Manager",
	"Website Manager",
	"Workspace Manager",
];

